#15415
The Pirate's Fodder Tavern~
   You have to squeeze by several people just to get in the doorway, and the 
smell almost drives you out. It seems there has been some sort of dedicating
contest, at least you hope that's not what the liquor smells like. The smell
doesn't seem affect the tavern's popularity as every seat is taken and the
floor is littered with inebriated bodies. Looking around you see that this 
place is not only for drinking and the occasional defication. A knife throwing
duel is taking place in one corner. In another you see a couple doing things
they should do in private. Several eyes are fixed on you and your purse. But
still, this place has a certain attraction. Perhaps it is the seediness.
   There are exits to the waterfront west and south if you want to make your
escape.
~
