#15456
Graveyard~
   You have wandered into what you would think would be an old graveyard,
but many of the graves are fresh. The ones that do have tombstones are
freshly cut, not one weathered with age. There must have been a slaughter
nearby recently.
   There is a mausoleum in the center of the graveyard. Nearing it, you see 
that there are tiles missing from the floor, leaving a hole down into the
darkness. You peer into the darkness and see that it is a long fall indeed.
You certainly would not survive.
~
